@startuml

title Conversational Scientific CLI - Session Resume Activity

start
:Receive human command;
:Resolve intent;

if (START or CONTINUE?) then (yes)
  :Resolve study manifest;
  :Resolve canonical repository;
  :Resolve active branch / PR / investigation;
  :Read current commit;
  :Read last checkpoint / reviewed commit;
  :Load open review findings;
  :Load resolved findings awaiting verification;
  :Load latest experiments and evidence;
  :Resolve curated sources if relevant;
  :Compute meaningful delta;
  :Display checkpoint;
  stop
else (no)
  :Load minimum context required by bounded command;
endif

if (STATUS?) then (yes)
  :Display state only;
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (REVIEW / CHECK / CHALLENGE / TRACE / EVIDENCE?) then (yes)
  :Perform one bounded scientific action;
  :Expose assumptions, evidence, findings and uncertainty;
  :Persist material state change when project supports it;
  :Display result and recommended next bounded action;
  stop
else (no)
  :Ask only if intent cannot be resolved safely;
  stop
endif

@enduml
